<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">1 Piyeer</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Piyeer</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Piyeer koc kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Piyeer koc kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Piyeer ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu. Saaŋ na Saak na Piyeer ɓeɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kaahay ci tiik ciŋ ɓa uup woyu ŋ teereeci nikiis ci na naandsuke kipes kiŋ Yeesu. Marka Piyeer ŋ Limiŋ tiik ci. Ŋ teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci", tiikiŋ Piyeer namiɗ pul nga waas laayiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1-5">Tum ci 1–5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8-12">8–12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15">15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ jamanoona Piyeer na fiise kaɓɗohii, a nikee ŋ "kur-taahi na woyse Babilon",<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:3">1 Piyeer 5:3</ref></char></note> te wa miniɗ nik ne tiikeem waaɗee woo <char style="w">Rom</char>. A nikee nga na Maarko yi fiis "Yegɗohiŋ Muci Maarko fiis".<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:13">1 Piyeer 5:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Piyeer fiisiɗ kaɓɗohii wuu kosiɗ ci nikee ŋ ini wil ŋ ɗiski Turki nik woti,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:1">1 Piyeer 1:1</ref></char></note> mbaa wa miniɗ nik ne Silweng yi woosu ne a wik kaɓɗohii,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:12">1 Piyeer 5:12</ref></char></note> a wiliɗ ɓak ceem jen naa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Piyeer fiisiɗ kaɓɗohii ne a ñaah ɓa, ɓa ndengɗuk, ɓa ooluk Kooh te ɓa ris ɗe kerhiɗ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Piyeer koc kaɓɗoh kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗoh na yakiɗ Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-12">1:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kipes hooliɗ wuu Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:3">1:13–2:3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> a yi atoh fi amb taɓahi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 2:4-10">2:4-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Jangɗoh findi ɓo' joy pesoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-3:12">2:11–3:12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ndengɗuk ŋ ɗooƴ miskiɗ ci <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 3:13-4:19">3:13–4:19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi yakak ci na kosiɗ ci jen joy mand <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, mi yi Piyeer, <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootariŋ</char></char> Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>. Mi yii fiis ɗu kaytii, ɗu ɓi Kooh kooɗ te ɗu pesee findi hanhe, ŋ pasarkohi ɗu pasarkoh ŋ kur ciŋ Pontos na Galaat na Kapados na Asi na Bitini. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Kooh Baabi kooɗiɗ ɗu ŋ findi a inhohee in ci bala ca hayan ɗah, ŋ hoolɗi <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hooliɗ ɗu. A kooɗiɗ ɗu ne ɗu kerhiɗ Yeesu Kiristaa te ɗu lisu ñif miŋ ɗe. Baahohsaat, ɗu onu jam te wa ɓaatkee ɓaatuk !<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ini ɓoo yaakaar minɗi yahuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Kooh yakɗaah, Koohiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa, a nammba nik Baabiŋ ɗe. Ŋ miski ɓoo misik ɗe keeh-keeh, a tumiɗ po ɓoo rimkissiɗ, a onnda ɓoo yaakaari na pese taamboh ŋ hultiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />In ci a gap ɓoo minɗi yahuk, ca soɓe'anɗi te moɗkiŋ ca minɗi coot, ɗu ɗaakɗuuɗ ca ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Te ɗu sah, Kooh a yii niiɗ ɗu na hatiliŋ ɗe taamboh ŋ kosi ɗu kos ne ɗu raak muc. Muceem ƴutiɗ ne a teeɓoha ŋ jamanooni mirndoh.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ineem weɗ tah ɗu riifiɗ na sum, ali nik ne sah ɓi neeh ceɗɗi, ɗu ɓii ŋ miskiɗ, a Kooh na markiskee ɗu, markiskohaaɗ nu nik. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Miskiɗ ceem na hee teeɓohe ne kosiŋ ɗu koceet, findi koceetiŋ ursi na markohse ngaŋ yongkaah. Te urus na geneeɗi, a kosiŋ ɗu uupa fuuf. Weɗ tah Yeesu Kiristaa teeɓohuk ɗah, Kooh hey ɗu ɗaape, a yakiɗ ɗu, a meeɓ ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Yeesu, ɗu hotɗi ɗe te moona ɗu waaɗiɗ ɗe. Ɗiski wa nik, ali nik ne ɗu hotɗi ɗe sah, ɗu kosiɗ ɗe, ɗu sumoh na sumoh, ɗu sumiɗ sumi nguɓ minɗi woo, ɗu sumiɗ po ɗu minisɗi sum. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Ɗu ɓii rahas ƴin ƴin muci kosiŋ ɗu mirndohan ɗu on.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woosuuɗ ci na muci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Ini kaɗ ŋ muceem, woosuuɗ ci ɗeɓgaan markiɗa, markissaa baahiɗ wi ɓa yegɗohee baahohi Kooh baahohan ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Ɓa markiɗa ne ɓa inah ina wala jamanoona Fuuɗsiŋ Kiristaani nikee nga ɓa woyoh na ɓa. A woyee na ɓa ŋ in ci na haye, ini kaɗ miskiɗ ciŋ Kiristaani na yaki a yakan ŋ finho miskiɗ ceem. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Ɓa teeɓuuɗ ne wa nikee wuu ɓa ŋ haf ɓa haa, waaye wuu ɗu. Te ɗiski wa nik, in ceem, a Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani woosohu Eel ci woo ɗu ca, taamboh ŋ ɓi yegɗohee muci. Malaakaaci sah waaɗiɗ ca marak keeh-keeh po inah.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kipes hooliɗ wuu Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Kon tokɗukaat, ɗu yun hel ciŋ ɗu. Oolkiŋ ɗu jen nikaat ŋ baahohi ɗu baahohsan mbeha Yeesu Kiristaa teeɓohkan. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Findi kuɓuuci kerhiɗ ɓi rim ɓa, kinaat taambiɗ waaɗ-waaɗ ci ɗu raakee wotɓa wa ɗu inahɗi Kiristaani ; <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />waaye hoolaat ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu jen findi Yi ɓeeɗuk ɗu hooloh, <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />wa fiisuuɗ ne : « Ɗu joy joy hool, laam, mi, ŋ hooliɗ. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Lewiici 11:44-45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Kooh, a yi na atte'e ɓooɓi jen, yaa nu nga ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe, te wa raakɗi talsoh. Te nik ne Kooh yeem, a yi ɗu na ɓeeɗke Baab ne ɗu kiimee ɗe ɗah, nupaat ɗe ŋ jamanooni ɗu nikoh hanhe ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ɗu inhiɗ ne ini tos ɗu ŋ pesohaaɗi raakaaɗi njirñi ɗu lamoh ŋ caac ciŋ ɗu, wa ini na reehe findi haalis wala urus haa. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Waaye ɗu tosohu ñif miŋ Kiristaani wi uupiɗ njiriñ fuuf, wa mand na ñif miŋ mbaali raakaaɗi sikka wala haawsuk.<verse eid="1PE 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Kooh inheen ɗe bala Adina fersan, te a teeɓohiɗ ɗe ŋ mirndaaniŋ jamanooni saguuɗu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Ɗu, ɗu kosiɗ Kooh taamboh nga ɗe, Kooh yi hultiɗ ɗe, yakiɗta ɗe ne kosiŋ ɗu na yaakaariŋ ɗu gaƴuk ŋ Kooh.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Ɗu kerhiɗiɗ keeh ki po ɗu hoolɗiɗ haf ɗu ne ɗu waaɗoh waaɗohi hunɗi na naafeeha, ɗiski wa nik, waaɗtiɗohaat waaɗtiɗoh keeh-keeh na keeñ hooliɗ. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Laam ɗu rimkissiɗ, te ɗu rimukɗi ŋ ɓoyi na kaane, ɗu puloh ŋ tisohi na yahkeeɗi, woo kiŋ Kooh, wi na pese te wa genan gen. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Fiis ci woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">« Ɓo', a paangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">yaki a yak jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">wa pos paangi ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">paangi na suye suy</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">posi yaɗ,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />waaye woo kiŋ Heɗi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:25">risan ris po faw.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Esayi 40:6-8</ref></char></note> »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Te woo keem weɗ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ɗu woyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Kon saɓsukohaat na in nu nik añaand wala ñaañoh, naafeeha, siis wala ɗooɓoh ɗah. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Findi komaakci han rimu na waaɗohe miis koceet, waaɗohaat ɗaa woo kiŋ Kooh, weɗ min ɗu hooɗiɗ po ŋ muca. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Laam ɗu ƴoohiɗ po ɗu inhiɗ findi Heɗi baahoh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marka ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:9">Sabuur 34:9</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atoh fi amb taɓahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Reɓaat ŋ Heɗi, a yi atoh fi na pese. Wa keeh ne ɓooɓi mbet ɗe mbet, waaye Kooh kooɗiɗ ɗe, te a waaɗaah keeh-keeh nga ɗe. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Ɗu ŋ haf ɗu, findi atoh ci na pese, nikaat atoh taɓahoha kahan Kooh. Ɗu nik cuuɓ seeƴkiɗoh hooliɗ wuu ce, ne ɗu seeƴkee ɗe na in ci baahiɗ ci <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na tumɗukohee ɗu. Ca nik seeƴuk ci neɓ ɗe taamboh ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Laam inii weɗ Fiis ci woo :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">« Mi yii yip atoh fi amb taɓahi ngaŋ Siyong.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Wa atoh fi ŋ kooɗ, atoh waaɗaah keeh-keeh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">te yaa nu taɓah kosiŋ ɗe nga ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">a kaci'anɗi nga muk.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Esayi 28:16</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kon, ini kaɗ nga ɗu, ɗu ɓi kosiɗ ci, atoh feem waaɗaah lool. Waaye ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosaaɗiici, Fiis ci woo ne : « Atoh fi taɓahoh ci mbete mirndohiɗ nik atoh fi amb taɓahi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sabuur 118:22</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Te ŋ Fiis ci poyi wa « atoh fi na kafndohe, folohe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Esayi 8:14</ref></char></note> » Kosaaɗiici ɓa ɗii kafnduk ŋ atoh feem, laam ɓa teyɗukɗi woo kiŋ Kooh. Ineem weɗ ini joyee ɓa rahas.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Waaye ɗu nak, ɗu cuuɓ kooɗuuɗ, cuuɓ seeƴkiɗoh wuu Kooh Buuri, cuuɓ hooliɗ wuu ce, cuuɓi a raakoot. Ɗu nikiɗ in ceem ne ɗu yegɗoh in ci moɗohngaan ci a haɓiɗ. A yi ɓeeɗuk ɗu, ɗu pulla ŋ ñuusi, ɗu hayya ŋ siñaariŋ ɗe moɗohngaani.<verse eid="1PE 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Wotɓa, ɗu nikeeɗi cuuɓ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:10">waaye woti, ɗu cuuɓiŋ Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:10">wotɓa, ɗu rahseeɗi yirmohiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:10">waaye woti, ɗu rahsiɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:6">Hose 1:6</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 1:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:1">2:1</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 2:25">25</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pes findi kosiɗ ŋ Adina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, ɗu ɓi genohaah findi hanhe ŋ kehƴi, mi yii ñaah ɗu, ne ɗu wortuk taambiɗ in ci neɓ kiñin ciŋ ɗu, ci na hiñohe na ini nik nga ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Raakaat pesohaaɗ moɗiɗ ŋ harmban kosaaɗiici, ne ɓa yambee ɗu ne ɗu tumoh moɗaaɗi ɗah, ɓa hot tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu moɗiɗ ci te ɓa yakiɗ Kooh ŋ mbehi a hayohan na hatil.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Teyɗukaat kikilifa nu nik, sagu Heɗi, teyɗukɗaat buuri yakkiŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, yi adgoh kur ki, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />na goornoor ci a na tuuƴe ne ɓa kuƴis tumoh moɗaaɗiici, ɓa ɗaap tumoh baahiɗ ci. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Laam, ineem weɗ Kooh waaɗ, ɗu tumee in baahiɗ ne ɗu rang nguɓ ciŋ naandiɗ ci na woye sagu inhaaɗi. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ɗu tumohan ɗaa findi ɓoyi raak haf ce, te kinaat ɗasɗuk ŋ raaki ɗu raak haf ɗu, ɗu tumee in baahaaɗi, waaye tumaat findi ɓoyi na ñaamke Kooh. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Eɗaat ɓooɓi jen cir, ɗu waaɗ mboolndiŋ kosiɗ ci, ɗu nup Kooh, ɗu eɗ buuri cir.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muñ miskiɗ ci findi Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Ɗu ɓi <char style="w">ñaam</char> ci, kerhiɗaat heɗ ciŋ ɗu, ɗu eɗ ɓa cir keeh-keeh. Ŋ wooɗi ɓi baah, te ɓa soossa dong, waaye kerhiɗaat sah añaandiɗ ci. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Laam a tum in baahiɗ, ɓoyi na muñe miskiɗ ci a yeyyooɗi, te Kooh dong tah. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />A raak wi nde ndam nga, ɓoyi muñ laɓ sagu tum ini lahɗi waas ? Waaye ɗu muñee miskiɗ ci, raak ɗu tum baahiɗ ɗah, ɗu tum in baahiɗ ŋ fiki Kooh.<verse eid="1PE 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Te Kooh ɓeeɗuk ɗu ŋ ineem, laam Kiristaani ŋ haf ce, a nameen raak miskiɗ wuu ɗu, a faɗiɗta ɗu taambɗaah, ne ɗu taamb ŋ kot ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />A moosɗi tum ali bakaaɗ, te woo ñaañoh moosɗi puloh ŋ nguɓiŋ ɗe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ini kooɗoh ŋ aaya 22 po 25, wa mand haa ne Piyeer na woye woo ci nik ŋ teerndiŋ woosuuɗi Esayi, <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53">Esayi 53</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />A ɓasuusa ɗah, a na wirndukeeɗi. A deguusa miskiɗ ɗah, a na gapkoheeɗi, waaye a na wike haf ce ŋ yaah ciŋ Atte'ohi yurhiɗi.<verse eid="1PE 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />A yi ŋ haf ce, a yi gaduk bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo ŋ faaniŋ ɗe ŋ daaƴa a daaƴu ŋ kurwaana ne ɓoo reehɗukoh na bakaaɗ, aas ŋ kipes yurhiɗ. E gaañ ciŋ ɗe wiriɗ ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Laam ɗu muuƴee muuƴ findi mbaal, waaye ɗiski wa nik ɗu dokkiɗ ŋ niiɗohi na niiɗee ɗu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Findi kanak ci kilookoh joy pesoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Ɓitiɓ ci, namaat teyɗukiɗ ƴaar ciŋ ɗu. Wa raak ŋ ƴaar ceem ɓi sang kos woo kiŋ Kooh ɗah, mandohaaɗiŋ ɗu miniɗ tah po ɓa kos, te wa etohanɗi sah, ɗu woyee na ɓa nga. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Ŋ ineem, ɓa hey hote findi ɗu eɗoh ɓa cir, na findi ɗu na pesohe pes hooliɗ. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Kimoɗ kiŋ ɗu kinaat nik ŋ ini min hotuk dong, maanaam ŋ maaruk, wala tokkaah urus, wala ɓekuk kulɓa moɗiɗ. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Waaye wa joy nik ŋ ɗooƴi, ŋ ɗooƴ keeñi ; wa nik wiŋ keeñ moɗiɗ, yeeɓkiɗ. Kimoɗ mand ɗaa, weɗ raak candoom keeh-keeh ŋ fiki Kooh te wa na yahkeeɗi.<verse eid="1PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ɗeɓgaan, ɓitiɓ ci hooliɗ ci oolkee Kooh ŋ in ci a gapohee, meeɗ haɓɗukoh ɗaa, ɓa teyɗukɗeen ƴaar ciŋ ɓa, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />findi Saarata kerhiɗohee Ibrahiima te a ɓeeɗkohee ɗe heɗ ce.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Camba 18:12</ref></char></note> Ɗu kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ne ɗu tumee baahiɗ te ɗu neƴƴohɗi ali in nga ɗah.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Ɗu ɓi ƴaar ci, yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah namaat liiɓ baahiɗ ŋ findi a na pesohe na ɓitiice, fu inah ne hatiliŋ ɓitiifu hendɗi na wiŋ ɗa. Eɗa ɗe cir laam a hey name ɓaah ŋ findiifu ŋ kipes ki ɓoo baahohsan. Tumohaat ɗaa ne kiim ciŋ ɗu Kooh nikuu teyɗuksaaɗi.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tum baahiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Kon book, ɗu jen ɓaahaat liiɓohaaɗ, ɗu ɓaahee ini neɓ ɗu na wi misik ɗu, ɗu waaɗtiɗoh findi ɓooɓi ɓaah yaay na baab, ɓooɓi miskaat ɗu, te ɗu ruhsiɗ haf ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Ɓo' tum ɗu miskiɗ wala ɓa ɓas ɗu ɗah, kinaat wirnduk. Kiimɗaat ɓa barke, laam, Kooh ɓeeɗuk ɗu ne ɗu tumohee ɗaa, ɗu rahsee barke. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Laam, Fiis ci woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">« Ɓo' nu waaɗ raak kipes mitiɗ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">na mbeh neɓiɗ ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">a niiɗaat nguɓiŋ ɗe ŋ woo moɗaaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">po ali lee taambuu ŋ njootoot ciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />A us baahaaɗi, a tumee baahiɗ ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">a waakaat jam te a tiindee jam.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Laam has ciŋ Heɗi ca ɗii ŋ yurhiɗ ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">te a naar nof ŋ kiim ciŋ ɓa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Waaye tumoh moɗaaɗiici,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Heɗi na ñuusɗukee ɓa ñuusɗuk.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:13-17">Sabuur 34:13-17</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tufuk ne seede ini fu oolkoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Te sah, yaa tuman ɗu miskiɗ ne ɗu sawar ŋ tum baahiɗ ɗah ? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ali nik ne ɗu raak miskiɗ sagu yurhi ɗu yurah sah, ɗu neɓɗiɗ. Kinaat ɓa neƴƴoh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Kinaat ɓa neƴƴoh" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "Kinaat neƴƴoh ini ɓa neƴƴoh".</char></note>, te kinaat jaahiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">Esayi 8:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Waaye ambaat ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɗu ne <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> a yi hool wuu Kooh, te a yi Heɗi ; te ɓooɓi meekis ɗu ŋ oolki ɗu ooluk in ciŋ Kooh na haye ɗah, tufkaat ne ɗu lof ɓa. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Waaye lofaat ɓa na eɗef, wa hun na cir, hunaat na hel daliɗ po ɗu yambsee tumoh moɗaaɗi ɗah, ɓooɓi na yambee ɗu hot tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu baahiɗ ci ɗu raak ŋ Kiristaani, ɓa kaci.<verse eid="1PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Laam, kooɗoh miskiɗ ngaŋ tum in baahiɗ, nik ne weɗ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh ɗah, weɗ ngisoh kooɗoh miskiɗ ŋ tum in baahaaɗi.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndamiŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kiristaani namiɗ raak miskiɗ waas yino po faw wuu ɗaasuukiŋ bakaaɗ ci. A Yurhiɗi kaan wuu yurhaaɗiici, ne a ɓay ɗu ŋ Kooh. A apuuɗ ŋ kipes kiŋ faaniŋ ɗe waaye a pesɗuuɗ ŋ kipes ki hun na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>.<verse eid="1PE 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Weɗ a kaɗoh yegɗoha ŋ ruuh ca taƴu ŋ kaso. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Maanaam, ɓi sangee kerhiɗ Kooh ɗeɓgaan, wa a muñɗee ɓa ŋ jamanoona Noohin haɓɗohee gaala. Ɓooɓa aasee ŋ gaala laayeeɗi, ɓa nikee yasna-kaahay dong, ɓeɗ mucɗassee ŋ masma.<verse eid="1PE 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Wa nikee ñaamaariŋ ɓoktuki woti, wi ɓoo na rahse, ɓoo muc, wa na nihse riiɓ faan haa, waaye wa teyɗuk ɓeeɗkohiŋ Kooh na hel daliɗ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"teyɗuk ɓeeɗkohiŋ Kooh na hel daliɗ" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "kiim Kooh ne a on ɗa hel daliɗ".</char></note>. Wa muciɗ ɗu taamboh ŋ hultiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />A rapiɗ Asamaan, a yaa ŋ ñaahmaŋ Kooh, malaakaaci na nguurkoh ci na heɗ hatil ci jen degu ŋ yaah ce.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Faɗ pesohaaɗi maañiɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Kon, <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> degseen miskiɗ ŋ faaniŋ ɗe. Mbaa ɗu nak, ganaaykohaat liiɓohaaɗeem, laam, ɓo' nu degu miskiɗ ŋ faaniŋ ɗe ɗah, a reehɗukohiɗ na bakaaɗ. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Ini a taskoh kipes ŋ kehƴi, a taambɗissuu kiñin kiŋ ɗe, waaye a pesee ŋ ini Kooh waaɗ.<verse eid="1PE 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ee di', ɗeɓgaan, ɗu tumee ini neɓ kosaaɗiici. Ɗu meeɗ meeɗ cakaay, ɗu taambɗee kiñin ciŋ ɗu, ɗu laaree, ɗu mbuumbaayee na biiñ laayiɗ, ɗu ñaamkeeɗa kooh ci nikaaɗiici ñaamuk siɓaah. Ɗu maannja nga lool ; ɗiski wa nik, wa doyiɗ.<verse eid="1PE 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Kosaaɗiici feyuuɗ ŋ ini ɗu seeskisɗi hun na ɓa ŋ cakaayi miskiɗeem, ɓeɗi ɓas ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Waaye ɓa hey tahse Kooh yi ƴut ne a atte pesiɗ ci na kaaniɗ ci. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ineem weɗ tah kaaniɗ ci woyuuɗ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ne ɓa min pes ŋ fiki Kooh ŋ kipes ki hun na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>. Ɓa min pes, ali nik ne sah, ɓa hey atte'se findi ɓo' na atte'ohse, ngaŋ kipes ka ɓa raakee wa ɓa nikoh na faan caŋ ɓa.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pes na ɓooɓi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Reehiŋ in ci jen reɓiɗ. Kon hunaat na sagoociŋ ɗu te ɗu yunuk ne ɗu min kiim Kooh. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Ini uup raak njiriñ weɗ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Gonaah ci 10:12</ref></char></note>ne, ɗu waaɗtiɗoh keeh-keeh ŋ harmban ɗu, laam waaɗoh na tahe po bakaaɗ laayiɗ ulu. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Yaa nu nga ɗah dalɗaat morom ce baahiɗ ŋ kahan ce te wa hunuu na woo ƴin-ƴin.<verse eid="1PE 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah raakiɗ ini Kooh baahoh ɗe, a taambkohaat morom ce naa. Ŋ ineem, ɗu hey nike taambkohoh baahiɗ ŋ in ci ɗalohiɗ ci Kooh baahoh ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Yaa nu Kooh on min woo ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe ɗah, a woyaat ini Kooh woo. Yaa nu Kooh on a taambkohee ɓo' ɗah, a taambkohaat ɗe na hatili Kooh eɗ ɗe. Ŋ ineem, Kooh yakɗu ŋ in ci jen, taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, yi Heɗ kiyak na hatil, te wa genan gen po faw. Amiin !<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓaah ŋ miskiɗ ciŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, kinaat feyu ŋ yongkaahi ɗu nikoh ne wa markis ɗu, kinaata amboh in feyohiɗ. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Neɓsaat kay ŋ ɓaahi ɗu ɓaah ŋ miskiɗ ciŋ Kiristaani. Ŋ ineem, ɗu hey riife na sum keeh-keeh, ŋ mbehi yaki a yak teeɓohsan. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ɗu ɓasu sagu tiikiŋ Kiristaani ɗah, ɗu neɓɗiɗ, laam Fuuɗsi yaki, <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>, a yii nga ɗu.<verse eid="1PE 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ali ɓo' nga ɗu kinaat mbugalu sagu ne a ap ɓo', wala a rok rok, wala a tum in baahaaɗi wiiriis, wala a aas ŋ ini waas ce nikohɗi. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Waaye nik ne ɗu na mbugalse sagu ini ɗu nik <char style="tl">Kerceen</char> ɗah, kinaat raak kaci nga, yakɗaat Kooh ŋ mini ɗu min ɓay tiikeem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"yakɗaat Kooh ŋ mini ɗu min ɓay tiikeem" : Ngaŋ fiis ci ɗeɓgaan raakiɗ ci woo ne : "corkiɗaat Kooh ŋ ineem".</char></note>.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Jamanooni reyiɗ, jamanooni atteeni camboh ŋ ɓi kahan Kooh. Wa kockoh nga ɓoo ɗah, kon ɓi sang kos Yegɗohiŋ Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Muci, ɓa mirndohan na ? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Fiis ci woo ne : « Nik ne mucɗuukiŋ yurhiɗi yooɓɗi ɗah, moo, bakaaɗohi kaañ Kooh moocan nde ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Gonaah ci 11:31</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Mbaa, ɓi na raake miskiɗ, nik ne weɗ Kooh waaɗ ɗah, ɓa genaat tum in baahiɗ, te ɓa wik haf ɓa Kooh, a yi Ferohi, yi fu inah ne in nu a woo ɗah, a tuma.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Findi yakak ci joy taambkoh kosiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Kon, mi yii ñaah yakak ci adgoh ɗu, mi yi yakak findiiɓa, ŋ seede ngaŋ miskiɗ ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> te ŋ raakiɗ ɓak ŋ yaki a yak, wi teeɓohsan. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Mi yii ñaah ɗu yakak ci, taambkohaat gati Kooh dengkoh ɗu ; kinaata niiɗ ŋ ñak pehey, waaye niiɗaata sagu waaɗi ɗu waaɗa tum, findi Kooh waaɗoh. Ɗu joyɗi waak kopor nga ŋ ini lahɗi waas waaye ɗu joy niiɗ gatiŋ ɗu na sawar. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Ɓooɓi Kooh dengkoh ɗu, kinaat ɓa toon kikilifa ; waaye nikaat altiɗkohaah nga ɓa. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Ŋ ineem, Niiɗohi yaki hay ɗah, ɗu hey rahse raayaani moɗkiŋ wa minɗi yahuk.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Findi kosiɗ ci joy mand</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Ɗu ɓi komaakci, namaat kerhiɗ yakak ci. Ɗu ɓi kosiɗ ci jen ruhsiɗaat haf ɗu, ne yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah taambkohee morom ce, laam Fiis ci woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">« Kooh hunɗi na yaksiɗkoh ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">ɓi ruhsiɗ haf ɓa, ɓeɗ a na teeɓe baah kiŋ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Gonaah ci 3:34</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ruhsiɗaat haf ɗu ŋ fiki Kooh, yi raak hatil, ne a meeɓ ɗu ŋ jamanooni a waaɗoha. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Kaambsukaat jaahiɗ ciŋ ɗu jen nga ɗe, laam a yi na taambkohee ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Hunaat na sagoociŋ ɗu te ɗu yunuk ! Sangiɗiŋ ɗu, Seytaani, yii wil findi gayndeeni na ŋaare, a na waake ɓoyi a sifiñsohan. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ndengsiɗkohaat na ɗe na kos ndengiɗ. Te ɗu inah ne ɓaah ciŋ ɗu kosiɗ ci ŋ adinaani jen, ɓa ɗii raak miskiɗ findiiɗu.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Miskiɗiŋ ɗu hey ɓaate maañ ƴissuut. Waaye Kooh, yi Heɗ baahoh, ɓeeɗkiɗ ɗu ŋ haf ce ne ɗu ɓaah na ɗe ndamiŋ ɗe po faw ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani. Kooh yeem hey ɗu mitɗe, a ndengiɗ ɗu tir po ali in minanɗi ɗu fol. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />A yi nikaat Heɗ hatil po faw ! Amiin !<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Ɓaah ɓoo Silweng, ŋ amb ɗe findi ɓaah cariɗ oolku, ŋ taamboh nga ɗe, ŋ kaɓɗohha ɗu woo ci rohƴiɗ cii, ne ŋ ñaah ɗu, ŋ seede'iɗ ɗu ne ɗu amb ŋ baahohiŋ Kooh keeh-keehi. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Ɓi Janguuni Kooh kooɗ findiiɗu ŋ kur-taahi na woyse Babilon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Babilon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ amb ne Piyeer teek <char style="w">Rom</char> Babilon ndii.</char></note>, ɓa ɗii kañiɗ ɗu. Maarko, kuɓuuso, yii kañiɗ ɗu. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Kañɗohaat ŋ harmban ɗu na morgiɗkoh huniɗ na waaɗoh. Ɗu ɓi nik ŋ Kiristaani jen, nikaat ŋ jam !<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>